  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 teaspoon dried rosemary",
    "0.5 teaspoon dried thyme",
    "0.25 teaspoon dried basil",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "4 lamb chops (3/4 inch thick)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "0.25 cup minced shallots",
    "0.33333334326744 cup aged balsamic vinegar",
    "0.75 cup chicken broth",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GFrRztJM5EQ-N1GknA1HRpunUHw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-1-144-750eff03b56443c094306b384e08144f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74037/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix rosemary, thyme, basil, salt, and pepper together in a small bowl; rub onto chops, coating both sides. Place chops onto a plate, cover, and let sit for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FMwphZ8i1uoUgSghE0vFGW1tQiU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-3-146-021dc5f1161348b4977db886aefa9389.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74037/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook chops in the hot skillet until no longer pink in the center, about 3 1/2 minutes per side for medium-rare. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 145 degrees F (63 degrees C). Transfer to a serving platter and keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k33G8SF4iuY7LlHju1AeCTWWx5k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-4-147-9303b8be0a2f4515a5878b063afe9b41.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74037/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add shallots to the skillet; cook and stir until just browned, 2 to 3 minutes. Pour vinegar into the pan and bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Add broth; cook and stir until sauce has reduced by half, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8MpHAhDiNNamMwwPtv4lwjHbsBM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-7-152-968b0da44d0842ff941cc9a56dd8ef33.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74037/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove sauce from the heat and stir in butter until melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jEMySA8glm9aJENmmvmzgRkRA_Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-8-153-d4975a3943e84c9cb7c8cd929905ccad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/74037/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve over chops. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7HxjNoBySy-r-qG6r7MFOAuQCr4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/74037-lamb-chops-with-balsamic-reduction-DDMFS-step-4x3-158-cc81d0fe528c4b07be2d7031e152f70b.jpg"
